"«Заменить список» удалит текущие исключения, включая добавленные вручную."
msgstr "Domains in the list: {domains}. Exclusions in general mode now: {existing}.\n\n“Add to current” keeps your sites and skips ones already added. “Replace list” removes current exclusions, including manually added ones."

